### Key Review Findings & Boundary Verdict

- **Target Commit**: `747fb6b1ca579d2bb9d1c41688ff97bbe029dde1` (Tree HEAD: `4067de31e0ab3f0d1c1377b60c8a3db1fa6c76ed`)
- **Target File**: [`library_mirror.py`](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/6bbf0095-0d8/gemini/library_mirror.py)
